  "_help": "Every base gun and part, as simple shapes. Units are about 1 cm. +x points out of the muzzle, +y is up, +z is towards the viewer. Shape keys: t = type (box, cyl, sph, tor), p = position, r = rotation in degrees, m = material (body, accent, metal, dark, glass, glow, plastic), c = colour override. box: s = size. cyl: r1 = radius at the start, r2 = radius at the end (optional), l = length, ax = axis. sph: rad = radius, sc = scale. tor: rad = ring radius, tube = thickness, ax = axis the ring faces. anim: wobble or spin. nofit: leave out of the camera framing. Run `gundesigner validate` after editing.",
